WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
Xiao Shen is right

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,360
Whoever clears it out first uses it first

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,920
The rooftop is so big and everyone has their own decorations.

4
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,320
Don't make a fuss over this matter

5
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,810
Cheapskate

6
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,520
Brother Zhang still has something to do

7
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,960
The things I found last time I searched the building won't last long.

8
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,200
Now there are people starting to move outside.

9
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,200
We discussed it

10
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,560
Prepare to go out to find supplies today

11
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:16,680
You've been out by yourself before

12
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,600
I wanted to ask you if you wanted to go with me

13
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,240
A few rivers on the sixth floor at 12 noon

14
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,240
It's not very safe outside now

15
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,480
It's best to bring something for self-defense

16
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,990
Got it

17
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,630
No one knows what's going on outside.

18
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:29,150
Try not to spread it too thinly

19
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,630
A familiar group of two or three people

20
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,620
Taking care of each other Xiao Shen

21
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,270
you didn't bring anything

22
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:38,140
Just brought an empty bag, just in time

23
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:42,420
It’s more convenient if no one follows you

24
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,980
It's frozen into thick ice underneath.

25
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,860
The layer of blood above is getting thicker and thicker

26
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:53,030
finally arrived
